        "@value": "Juno Award-winning guitarist Steve Dawson joins Nashville multi-instrumentalist Fats Kaplin for an intimate evening of original songs, slide guitar, blues, Hawaiian, and ragtime at the York Theatre on March 19, 2027. Co-presented with Capilano University Centre for the Performing Arts."
